{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memento Dawn is a colorful puzzle game in which we can control the light and shadow to help the girl find a way to get back her memories. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A PUZZLE GAME FOR WHOLESOME EXPERIENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the girl's journey through a beautiful land where her memories are kept and help her answer the hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/story.png?t=1743908178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE BUT SIMPLE MECHANIC FOR EVERYONE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate light and shadow to create a path for the girl to go through the darkness. Collect memories to unfold a lovely story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1743908178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 100+ beautiful handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique gameplay with light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Simple but deep mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hint system and Undo each action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An adorable story told by charming illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Relaxing soundtracks with wholesome vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cute, family game for everyone. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2319360?t=1743908178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743908178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/337a036b7b37ee72b1405a7d19226d44b12fcd0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743908178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s